'''Rashad McCants''' was a member of the [[University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill|UNC]] basketball team from 2003-2005.  He played as shooting guard or small forward.  He helped lead UNC to win the [[Atlantic Coast Conference|ACC]] regular season and the [[NCAA Men's Division I Basketball Championship|NCAA tournament]] with a win over Illinois 75-70.
As of April 2005, McCants declared his eligibilty for the NBA draft instead of play basketball for his senior year at UNC.

